#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:5
msgid "Delete object"
msgstr "删除对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:7
msgid ""
"Choosing the correct `element`_, `conductor`_, `text field`_, etc. from the "
"beginning is always nice, even so, QElectroTech allows deleting all type of "
"object that can be add to the folios (`element`_, `conductor`_, `text "
"field`_, `basic object`_  and `picture`_)."
msgstr ""
"从一开始选择正确的 `元件 <element_>`_，`导体 <conductor_>`_，`文本字段 <text field_>`_ "
"等总是不错的，即使如此，QEelectroTech允许删除可以添加到光圈的所有类型的物体(`元件 <element_>`_，`导体 "
"<conductor_>`_，`文本字段 <text field_>`_，`基本对象 <basic object_>`_ 和 `图片 "
"<picture_>`_)."

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:13
msgid ""
"Multiples objects can be deleted at the same time `selecting multiples "
"object`_."
msgstr "多个对象可以同时删除 `选择多个对象 <selecting multiples object_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:15
msgid ""
"Deleting objects can be done from `menu bar`_, `toolbar`_, by right click on"
" the object and using the corresponding keyboard shortcut."
msgstr "删除对象可以从 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_，`工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中通过右键点击对象并使用相应的键盘快捷键完成。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:19
msgid "Delete object from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏中删除对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:21
msgid "`Select the object/s`_ which should be delete."
msgstr "`选择应当删除的对象/s <Select the object/s_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:22
msgid "Select **Edit > Delete** menu item to delete the object."
msgstr "选择 **编辑 > 删除** 菜单项以删除对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:27
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech edit menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:30
msgid "Delete object from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏中删除对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:32
#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:57
msgid "`Select the object/s`_ which should be deleted."
msgstr "`选择应当删除的对象/s <Select the object/s_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:33
msgid "Select the icon |edit-delete| from `toolbar`_ to delete the object."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择图标 |edit-delete| 删除对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:35
msgid "edit-delete"
msgstr "编辑-删除"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:39
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Tools**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 工具** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:42
msgid "Delete object by right click"
msgstr "右键删除对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:44
msgid "Right click on the object which should be deleted."
msgstr "右键单击应删除的对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:45
msgid "Select the option **Delete** to delete the object."
msgstr "选择选项 **删除** 删除对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:50
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech right click PopUP window"
msgstr "图：右键点击 PopUP 窗口的QElectroTech"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:53
msgid "Delete object using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键删除对象"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:55
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:58
msgid "Press ``delete`` to delete the object."
msgstr "按 ``delete`` 删除对象。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/delete.rst:62
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcuts, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
